# Fenced toolbox: the vendored tool code and venvs are NOT tracked.
# Only TOOLBOX.md (the manifest) and this .gitignore are committed, so the
# repo's parity gates and CI never see external source, but the toolbox is
# documented and reproducible.
*
!.gitignore
!TOOLBOX.md
!PUBLIC_APIS_REFERENCE.md
!venv-requirements.txt
